        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This adds docs for Permissions-Policy violation reports (<code class=\"notranslate\">PermissionsPolicyViolationReport</code>), along with changes I thought necessary to make it work.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This contributes to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4260378767\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43782\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43782/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43782\">#43782</a> (and  <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4217377323\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43688\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43688/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43688\">#43688</a>)</p>",
